    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/84e47a5285362c2e4a23f6d37bd2882d.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the Backrooms ... before analog horror ... there were the tapes.<br><br>Paratopic: Overdub revives the award-winning 2018 liminal horror classic: a twisting 3-in-1 remaster, remix, and sequel to the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/85f88f3368f51dd30341e31fdbc07fac.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=69 /></span><br>A first-person narrative horror game, now with improved textures and animations, new characters, and more secrets to discover. A surreal journey to the end of the night. Nothing is certain, nothing is true except for the narrative you piece together.<br><br>Country drives. Longwinded clerks. Sightseeing. Solitaire. Murder. A cut-up travelogue through the skeleton of Americana\u2014a land of motels, gas stations, late-night diners, and dead industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/79eb5b394e4c413b6199ec7d7eb4e118.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=76 /></span><br>From making numerous game-of-the-year lists and winning the 2019 Independent Game Festival excellence in audio award to influencing the retro horror boom, Paratopic is a landmark in independent horror games. <br> <br>Paratopic: Overdub takes you back. Rewind. Look closer. Keep watching</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/84e47a5285362c2e4a23f6d37bd2882d.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the Backrooms ... before analog horror ... there were the tapes.<br><br>Paratopic: Overdub revives the award-winning 2018 liminal horror classic: a twisting 3-in-1 remaster, remix, and sequel to the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/85f88f3368f51dd30341e31fdbc07fac.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=69 /></span><br>A first-person narrative horror game, now with improved textures and animations, new characters, and more secrets to discover. A surreal journey to the end of the night. Nothing is certain, nothing is true except for the narrative you piece together.<br><br>Country drives. Longwinded clerks. Sightseeing. Solitaire. Murder. A cut-up travelogue through the skeleton of Americana\u2014a land of motels, gas stations, late-night diners, and dead industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781550/extras/79eb5b394e4c413b6199ec7d7eb4e118.avif?t=1755273660\" width=610 height=76 /></span><br>From making numerous game-of-the-year lists and winning the 2019 Independent Game Festival excellence in audio award to influencing the retro horror boom, Paratopic is a landmark in independent horror games. <br> <br>Paratopic: Overdub takes you back. Rewind. Look closer. Keep watching</p>",
